{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_01",
  "title": "意外入选",
  "storyCode": "DH-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "35c5dfa9f61125306100808062092b0f379aa7d73fd3a14660fae094e48d0941",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（人感觉和汐斯塔一样多，不过氛围上完全不一样。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（到处都是酒吧、赌场、餐厅......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的游客",
      "text": "美女，要不要和我们一起去沙滩边玩啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "滚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（林雨霞一大早人就不见了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "......我准备再给那只下水道老鼠打个电话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "虽然我没怎么来过这里，但我觉得特殊部队一定在做可怕的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你见过贫民区的林吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "我见过。是个很和善的老人，比我爷爷好多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......他可是“鼠王”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "这几个人不都这样。但他真的是个好人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "我只是没想到雨霞她会变成现在这个样子。明明以前是个又胆小又腼腆的孩子，经常躲在你背后来着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我倒觉得她没有变。她只是......担负起了责任。也许并不该属于她的责任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（算了，反正她跑不了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "唉，来都来了，找点事做吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（做点什么呢......买土特产？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（星熊和诗怀雅她们......买回去还要寄，有点麻烦，等她们什么时候过来外勤给她们好了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（对了，也要给文月夫人准备一份谢礼。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（罗德岛的话......白雪，风笛，阿米娅，还有......她？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（算了。总之，人有点多，不知道能不能带得过来，看情况再说吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（不过感觉也要不了多少时间......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（到处走走？......反正干什么都要到处走的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（让那个埃内斯托带我参观一下城市的景点？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（......算了，不熟。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（对了，坎黛拉市长说的那件事......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "text": "最近这段日子里，城里的武器流通变得有些异常频繁，如果你们玩乐之余觉得有些不够刺激，那么，你们不妨试试调查着玩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（这个人明明是市长，却一点也不关心自己的城市，魏彦吾怎么会结交这样的人？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（而且这座城市，完全是纸醉金迷、骄奢淫逸的代名词......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（......诗怀雅说不定会喜欢这种地方，我宁愿回汐斯塔。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（唉，算了，来都来了，查案总比没事干强，还是查查看吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（虽然坎黛拉市长说查案的事也可以问埃内斯托，不过如果他们有明确的线索的话肯定早就行动了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（直接去问大概是问不出什么的，还是先到处走走，从了解城市开始吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懊恼的男游客",
      "text": "昨晚战况怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高兴的男游客",
      "text": "赢了几千，你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懊恼的男游客",
      "text": "啧，我输惨了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高兴的男游客",
      "text": "哈哈，没事，今天赢回来不就完了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懊恼的男游客",
      "text": "不用你说我也这么打算，*玻利瓦尔感叹词*，还是这里爽，我根本不想回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高兴的男游客",
      "text": "谁不是呢，一回到外面就又要看打打杀杀的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高兴的男游客",
      "text": "可惜啊，咱们没钱在这买套房子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懊恼的男游客",
      "text": "赌赢不就有了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高兴的男游客",
      "text": "哈哈哈，有道理！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热情的酒吧招待",
      "text": "这位美丽的小姐，有兴趣来我们酒吧工作吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热情的酒吧招待",
      "text": "像你这么漂亮的人，一晚上就能赚大钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "滚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "赌场、酒吧、餐厅、卡拉OK，这座城市里除了这些就没有别的了吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......距离海选结束，还有两天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陈转过头去，发现声音是从路边商店橱窗中摆放的电视机中传来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视台主持人",
      "text": "各位市民们，游客们，有在好好享受你们的假期吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视台主持人",
      "text": "我昨天在赌场输了三十万，今天可是打算去赢回来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视台主持人",
      "text": "那么，在经过为期十天的角逐后，多索雷斯极限大奖赛的海选将在今天结束！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视台主持人",
      "text": "而午后三点，也就是三个小时之后，我们将迎来海选中最后一场的大乱斗海选赛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视台主持人",
      "text": "是热爱大奖赛的你绝对不能错过的一场比赛！千万不要忘记前往比赛现场享受刺激的氛围！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视台主持人",
      "text": "当然，不想忍受炎炎夏日和拥挤的人群也不用着急，锁定我们的官方电视台，我们会准点为你直播赛事内容！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视台主持人",
      "text": "对了，这里还有一条说不定会让音乐爱好者们非常兴奋的消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视台主持人",
      "text": "是的，可能你们已经听到了消息，坎黛拉市长居然请来了塞壬唱片旗下的知名音乐人，D.D.D.。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视台主持人",
      "text": "而且，这位蒙面示人的音乐人，不仅将为我们带来她那奔放的电子乐，还将担任本次大奖赛的特邀主持！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的男游客",
      "text": "妮娜，快点，你没听到吗，还有一个小时比赛就开始了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懒散的女游客",
      "text": "打架有什么好看的，太野蛮了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的男游客",
      "text": "混战海选出线的人都是比赛的黑马，不注意一下可不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懒散的女游客",
      "text": "那你去看吧，看完记得告诉我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的男游客",
      "text": "你这女人......啧，算了，自己去就自己去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热爱音乐的男游客",
      "text": "喂，真的假的，我前几天就听说D.D.D.来了，没想到是真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热爱音乐的女游客",
      "text": "我记得她上个月好像还在汐斯塔，居然现在就到多索雷斯来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热爱音乐的女游客",
      "text": "而且居然能请动她来当主持，坎黛拉市长究竟是怎么说服她的？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热爱音乐的男游客",
      "text": "她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热爱音乐的女游客",
      "text": "你不知道？现在不少人都在猜，D.D.D.很有可能是一名女性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热爱音乐的男游客",
      "text": "哦......我是觉得是男是女都无所谓，反正我们有耳福了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陈意识到，几乎所有人都在谈论着比赛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（这场比赛，看来确实受到这座城市里大部分人的关注。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（......要想在比赛之中搞事情，对方肯定不会放过作为参赛选手混入其中，伺机制造混乱的机会。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（既然如此......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "喂，是陈小姐吗？哈哈，抱歉，我这边现在稍微有些不方便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "喝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "手机那边传来的声音",
      "text": "嘎啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你在和人战斗？发生了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "这就有些说来话长了，简单来说，林小姐和人打起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你现在在哪里？我来找你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "好，我在......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三小时前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你为什么要帮他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "幼稚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "林小姐，需要我帮忙吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你说过，你对这座城市很熟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "背景独立的小赌场，有没有办法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "背景独立......您是想要惹事了不会有什么大问题的那种？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "这样的话您不用担心，有坎黛拉女士在，谁都不敢找您的麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "不，我想要的是，收拾起来不麻烦的那种。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "......我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "是这家？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "是的，这是一家酒吧赌场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "老板阿拉斯白手起家，靠着一股狠劲硬生生在这条街上把这家店开到这么大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "周围几条街的势力都很想要他这家店，不过谁都啃不下他这块硬骨头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你在这里等着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场喽啰",
      "text": "请问您是要喝酒还是玩两把？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "玩两把。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场喽啰",
      "text": "好、好厉害的女人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场喽啰",
      "text": "快，快去把老板叫过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "小姐，我不管你是谁，但你太狂妄了，一个人来这样的地方闹事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "别说废话。开牌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "四条。呵呵呵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "同花顺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "怎么可能？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "你藏牌的手法太差了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "小姐，我承认你可能确实有些本事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "把你们的武器都掏出来吧，我赶时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "啧，小的们，上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "虽然事先有做过调查......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "不过，这就是龙门鼠王之女的做法吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "林雨霞呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "陈小姐，您来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "那帮人打不过林小姐就跑了，林小姐追去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "往哪个方向？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "text": "那边，沙滩方向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "知道了，我去看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "跑得还挺快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "林雨霞，你在搞什么东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "陈晖洁？你来干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "是我在问你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "啧，哪来的神经病，打不过，还甩不掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场喽啰",
      "text": "老大，我们怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "还能怎么办，跑啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "那边是......混战海选会场？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "嘿，正好。我们混进去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "找到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "现在没空管你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "站住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "找到你们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "这都要追上来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "哼，不过这里可是有许多我天然的帮手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "text": "小的们，上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这里是......刚才电视里说过的乱斗比赛会场？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "啧，没办法，先把周围的人都解决掉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
